{
  "id": "c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Water: a precious resource",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good afternoon. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how much do you think about the water you use every day?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, have you ever experienced a water shortage?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what natural resources are most important in your country?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think people waste natural resources?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e40-a1",
            "c1-e40-a2",
            "c1-e40-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show different attitudes to water. Choose two of the pictures and say what problems might be connected with these situations, and how the people involved might be affected.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these situations do you find the most unfair?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e40-b1",
            "c1-e40-b2",
            "c1-e40-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people who rely on water. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people might be worried about, and what the future could hold for them.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11100
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, how can individuals save water?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some measures to protect water supplies, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 9900
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these measures help to secure future water supplies?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7100
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would be the most effective?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about water and natural resources.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Should water be treated as a human right rather than a product?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, to what extent should people be punished for wasting water during a drought?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, could conflicts over water increase in the future?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is it fair for industry to use large amounts of water when households are asked to save it?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think technology can solve water shortages?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, why do many people take clean water for granted?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e40-water-a-precious-resource/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
